{"data": [{"author_id": "2022116519048892416", "created_at": "2026-10-30T18:01:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116228976884498777"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OtPMyPpSwd", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/realhumansfirst/status/2116228976884498777/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116228974246346752", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/OtPMyPpSwd"}]}, "id": "2116228976884498777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$2 billion in American AI chips, headed for data centers serving Chinese customers.\n\nThe suspected Chinese operative at Megaspeed reportedly arranged a $2 billion Nvidia chip purchase for data centers in Malaysia and Indonesia. Investigators once found chips still sitting https://t.co/OtPMyPpSwd", "url": "https://x.com/realhumansfirst/status/2116228976884498777"}, {"author_id": "1220875086", "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:00:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115957020788511094"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 96, "start": 87, "tag": "Malaysia"}, {"end": 100, "start": 97, "tag": "AI"}], "urls": [{"description": "Malaysia seizes servers with advanced AI chips suspected of violating export controls", "display_url": "newdelhitimes.com/malaysia-seize…", "end": 124, "expanded_url": "https://www.newdelhitimes.com/malaysia-seizes-servers-with-advanced-ai-chips-suspected-of-violating-export-controls/", "images": [{"height": 1179, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115957034168262656/3qS0jqlI?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115957034168262656/3qS0jqlI?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 101, "status": 200, "title": "Malaysia seizes servers with advanced AI chips suspected of violating export controls", "unwound_url": "https://www.newdelhitimes.com/malaysia-seizes-servers-with-advanced-ai-chips-suspected-of-violating-export-controls/", "url": "https://t.co/opb6PfbmBq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/dFOKxGTmoC", "end": 148, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NewDelhiTimes/status/2115957020788511094/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115957017923706880", "start": 125, "url": "https://t.co/dFOKxGTmoC"}]}, "id": "2115957020788511094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 88, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysia seizes servers with advanced AI chips suspected of violating export controls \n#Malaysia #AI\nhttps://t.co/opb6PfbmBq https://t.co/dFOKxGTmoC", "url": "https://x.com/NewDelhiTimes/status/2115957020788511094"}, {"author_id": "1659101737767034880", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:47:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115651600450806065"], "id": "2115651600450806065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysia intercepted $12.2 million shipment of servers with AI chips suspected of violating export controls.", "url": "https://x.com/TiqNew/status/2115651600450806065"}, {"author_id": "27454144", "created_at": "2026-10-29T07:25:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115706500014305365"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Malaysia introduced permit requirements for shipping AI chips of U.S. origin last year, under pressure from the U.S. to prevent rerouting to China", "display_url": "fortune.com/2026/10/28/mal…", "end": 131, "expanded_url": "https://fortune.com/2026/10/28/malaysia-intercepted-ai-chips-shipment-export-controls-china/", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115706501520093184/EtlZ-d_3?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115706501520093184/EtlZ-d_3?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 108, "status": 200, "title": "Malaysia intercepted $12.2 million shipment of servers with AI chips suspected of violating export controls | Fortune", "unwound_url": "https://fortune.com/2026/10/28/malaysia-intercepted-ai-chips-shipment-export-controls-china/", "url": "https://t.co/9FFEv1o8IR"}]}, "id": "2115706500014305365", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysia intercepted $12.2 million shipment of servers with AI chips suspected of violating export controls https://t.co/9FFEv1o8IR", "url": "https://x.com/arnaudmercier/status/2115706500014305365"}, {"author_id": "2114053441836244992", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:24:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115827043594039330"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/nJYlbjghe3", "end": 223, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/trusencecom/status/2115827043594039330/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115827040817418240", "start": 200, "url": "https://t.co/nJYlbjghe3"}]}, "id": "2115827043594039330", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysia seizes $12 million in AI chips hidden inside 30 servers\n\nThe case points to a transit network, and Malaysia has since tightened export controls on US-origin AI chips at Washington's request. https://t.co/nJYlbjghe3", "url": "https://x.com/trusencecom/status/2115827043594039330"}, {"author_id": "1819467740744503297", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:05:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115807256264745272"], "id": "2115807256264745272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysia customs seizes 30 servers packed with advanced AI chips worth $12.1M at Kuala Lumpur airport. The chips move like contraband because they basically are. Export controls built a smuggling economy faster than anyone built supply.", "url": "https://x.com/FloRyRy410/status/2115807256264745272"}, {"author_id": "1924330034535493632", "created_at": "2026-10-29T17:52:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115864239558767097"], "id": "2115864239558767097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysian customs seized ~$12.1M of advanced AI chips this month, Reuters reports: 30 server units found Oct 15 at Kuala Lumpur airport, falsely declared as electronic components. Export controls are now being enforced at the departure gate.", "url": "https://x.com/Novaris12138/status/2115864239558767097"}, {"author_id": "2047623249333559296", "created_at": "2026-10-29T08:17:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115719583269257588"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 210, "start": 204, "tag": "Chips"}, {"end": 226, "start": 211, "tag": "Semiconductors"}, {"end": 236, "start": 227, "tag": "TradeWar"}, {"end": 245, "start": 237, "tag": "Markets"}, {"end": 249, "start": 246, "tag": "AI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/A5RviCtozx", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BlueTearsPT/status/2115719583269257588/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115719250505818112", "start": 250, "url": "https://t.co/A5RviCtozx"}]}, "id": "2115719583269257588", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "US export controls just widened again — more Chinese firms on the list.Every restriction is a recruiting poster for China's chip self-sufficiency. Who actually wins a trade war fought with semiconductors?#Chips #Semiconductors #TradeWar #Markets #AI https://t.co/A5RviCtozx", "url": "https://x.com/BlueTearsPT/status/2115719583269257588"}, {"author_id": "895022610857299968", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:00:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115866391437815906"], "id": "2115866391437815906", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 370, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysian customs seized servers with AI chips at Kuala Lumpur airport. Officials say they were in transit to another Asian country without a permit. Under US pressure, Malaysia brought in export controls on advanced US AI chips last year to stop them from reaching China.", "url": "https://x.com/greatgamemaps/status/2115866391437815906"}, {"author_id": "178891512", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:20:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115795860898586634"], "id": "2115795860898586634", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Malaysia just seized $12 million of advanced AI chips at Kuala Lumpur airport - servers falsely declared as electronic components and routed through the free trade zone to dodge chip export controls. The controls now have a smuggling economy.", "url": "https://x.com/Sureshsinghn/status/2115795860898586634"}, {"author_id": "2415399587", "created_at": "2026-10-29T17:48:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115863342698897494"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/cnbc/status/21…", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/cnbc/status/2115836709954814097", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/LPzxK9NSFH"}]}, "id": "2115863342698897494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 137, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115836709954814097", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Before the NYT espionage allegations, the U.S. Commerce Dept was already investigating Megaspeed for allegedly helping Chinese firms bypass export controls to get Nvidia AI chips. Even as U.S. spy agencies tracked Alice Huang, they never warned Jensen Huang or Taiwan. https://t.co/LPzxK9NSFH", "url": "https://x.com/teshen8lin/status/2115863342698897494"}, {"author_id": "236482065", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:46:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115817627935191404"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 217, "start": 214, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 226, "start": 218, "tag": "AIChips"}, {"end": 242, "start": 227, "tag": "ExportControls"}, {"end": 252, "start": 243, "tag": "Malaysia"}, {"end": 261, "start": 253, "tag": "ChipWar"}, {"end": 266, "start": 262, "tag": "GPU"}, {"end": 273, "start": 267, "tag": "Chips"}, {"end": 279, "start": 274, "tag": "Tech"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/urVG2zeRAn", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SparkyMark96/status/2115817627935191404/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115817625255055360", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/urVG2zeRAn"}]}, "id": "2115817627935191404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 69, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "AI: Malaysia seized 30 servers of advanced AI chips (~$12.1M) at KLIA, declared as \"electronic components.\" 5th case tied to one syndicate this year.\n\nSources: Malay Mail, CNA, FMT\n\nCan export controls stop this?\n\n#AI #AIChips #ExportControls #Malaysia #ChipWar #GPU #Chips #Tech https://t.co/urVG2zeRAn", "url": "https://x.com/SparkyMark96/status/2115817627935191404"}, {"author_id": "126077209", "created_at": "2026-10-30T03:45:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116013534853419153"], "id": "2116013534853419153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 115, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Spies, chips, and Silicon Valley! 🚨 Recent reports alleging intelligence surveillance ties between foreign data center execs and tech leadership have put AI hardware security under the microscope. As export controls tighten, where do we draw the line between global business and", "url": "https://x.com/sairyabhb/status/2116013534853419153"}, {"author_id": "2046164287412920321", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:26:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115646525716271604"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 272, "start": 269, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 279, "start": 273, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/37pM0JjYAz", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Connected4Power/status/2115646525716271604/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115646385324171265", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/37pM0JjYAz"}]}, "id": "2115646525716271604", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Information: DeepSeek and Moonshot trained their October models heavily on OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra outputs.\n\nThe labs switched targets after Anthropic tightened its guard. Export controls stop chips at the border. They don't stop answers.\n\nWho builds the next fence?\n\n#AI #China https://t.co/37pM0JjYAz", "url": "https://x.com/Connected4Power/status/2115646525716271604"}, {"author_id": "1881168794", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:30:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115919133384605917"], "id": "2115919133384605917", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 5009, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Goldman Sachs’ Kim Posnett says investors are growing more selective about AI companies, favoring those that control models, chips and data centers. \n\nAt The Information’s WTF Summit, executives also described widening disagreements over chip export controls and the", "url": "https://x.com/theinformation/status/2115919133384605917"}, {"author_id": "137255482", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:31:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115617380307198422"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 38, "start": 29, "tag": "HongKong"}, {"end": 52, "start": 43, "tag": "mainland"}], "mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "25053299", "start": 10, "username": "FortuneMagazine"}]}, "id": "2115617380307198422", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 546, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Views for @FortuneMagazine: “#HongKong and #mainland markets barely budged because they sit outside the main U.S. AI supply chain. Export controls keep the most advanced chips out of Chinese hands, while users can already turn to cheaper domestic models from the likes of", "url": "https://x.com/Aligarciaherrer/status/2115617380307198422"}, {"author_id": "1377038774568292352", "created_at": "2026-10-29T02:17:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115629086349595127"], "id": "2115629086349595127", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI chips are becoming a strategic asset — and a geopolitical flashpoint.\n\nMalaysia reportedly seized servers containing advanced AI chips suspected of violating export controls. The case highlights how difficult it is to monitor high-value technology as it moves across borders.", "url": "https://x.com/Han_WorldBrief/status/2115629086349595127"}, {"author_id": "83790477", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:39:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115770597108338733"], "id": "2115770597108338733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China ran a spy close to Nvidia’s Jensen Huang: a Chinese executive at Singapore firm Megaspeed cultivated access, funneled intel to Beijing on advanced AI chips and ways around US export controls. \n\nUS agencies confirmed it via surveillance. \n\nTrump was briefed a year ago but", "url": "https://x.com/harish3912/status/2115770597108338733"}, {"author_id": "1881168794", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:30:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115571945873756604"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 13, "id": "1353836358901501952", "start": 1, "username": "AnthropicAI"}, {"end": 195, "id": "111627089", "start": 184, "username": "SarahKHeck"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6TZlMKRsov", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/theinformation/status/2115571945873756604/video/1", "media_key": "13_2115571844187111424", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/6TZlMKRsov"}]}, "id": "2115571945873756604", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 8128, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": ".@AnthropicAI wants to keep America's most advanced AI chips out of China's hands to maintain the U.S. lead in AI.\n\nAt The Information's WTF Summit, Anthropic's Head of Public Affairs @SarahKHeck explained the company's position on chip export controls.\n\n\"The easiest way to do https://t.co/6TZlMKRsov", "url": "https://x.com/theinformation/status/2115571945873756604"}, {"author_id": "2010272031603068928", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:27:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115978744166850850"], "id": "2115978744166850850", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5466, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "The US export controls worked. For Huawei.\n\nIDC counted China's data center AI chips for the first half of 2026.\nNvidia shipped 678K accelerators, down 44% in a year.\nHuawei shipped 572K, up from about 300K.\nThe whole market was 2M.\n\nFor the first time chips that are not GPUs", "url": "https://x.com/superalesha/status/2115978744166850850"}, {"author_id": "2029137119092871168", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:23:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115811733243580673"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/nytimes/status…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/nytimes/status/2115805793891098841", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/EaUV1fY9f2"}]}, "id": "2115811733243580673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115805793891098841", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The detail that jumps out in the Times report: Jensen Huang never got a defensive briefing, and companies tied to the Megaspeed exec kept buying Nvidia chips this year. Commerce agents had already found Nvidia gear still boxed at Megaspeed's Malaysia site. Nvidia says customers https://t.co/EaUV1fY9f2", "url": "https://x.com/shadownet1337/status/2115811733243580673"}, {"author_id": "1911611318131453953", "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:51:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115999960453804347"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hKhc7Ru92d", "end": 211, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/upshot_cards/status/2115999960453804347/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115999957396103169", "start": 188, "url": "https://t.co/hKhc7Ru92d"}, {"display_url": "x.com/intcyberdigest…", "end": 235, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/intcyberdigest/status/2115761060292567275", "start": 212, "url": "https://t.co/af1facvSa9"}]}, "id": "2115999960453804347", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 898, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115761060292567275", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "US &amp; Nvidia spend billions making sure china never gets the chips.\n\ncountless export controls, sanctions, congressional hearings just for bro to get cooked by a baddie at a taipei bar https://t.co/hKhc7Ru92d https://t.co/af1facvSa9", "url": "https://x.com/upshot_cards/status/2115999960453804347"}, {"author_id": "1430444360299024389", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:07:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115943559022911581"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/WillManidis/st…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/WillManidis/status/2115794572131651953", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/fdGSsdiJXK"}]}, "id": "2115943559022911581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115794572131651953", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "some learnings from this paper\n\nThe big money from AI will go to a few hard-to-copy chokepoints (compute, power, chips, data, distribution), not to the labs that build the models.\nLabs will keep spending even as returns fall, which could destroy value across the industry.\nAI https://t.co/fdGSsdiJXK", "url": "https://x.com/shakstzy/status/2115943559022911581"}, {"author_id": "19270995", "created_at": "2026-10-30T19:29:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116251065347883058"], "id": "2116251065347883058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 330, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NYT: US intel had judged Megaspeed exec Alice Huang, who was probed over possible Nvidia chip diversion to China, a Beijing asset close to Jensen Huang. Trump was briefed ~a year ago &amp; didn't act.\nFirms tied to her kept buying Nvidia chips this year.\nExport controls, meet dinner", "url": "https://x.com/mablum/status/2116251065347883058"}, {"author_id": "1347671200454107138", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:44:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115816971757334918"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 188, "start": 183, "tag": "NVDA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TfsURRKGhI", "end": 281, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/stockmom/status/2115816971757334918/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115816967961464832", "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/TfsURRKGhI"}]}, "id": "2115816971757334918", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2992, "like_count": 101, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 23}, "text": "🚨 🇨🇳 REPORT: US intelligence reportedly concluded that someone with close access to Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang was a Chinese intelligence asset. Huang himself isn't accused. China wants $NVDA chips and secrets, and this is exactly why export controls matter.🇺🇸 https://t.co/TfsURRKGhI", "url": "https://x.com/stockmom/